     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "D'entre + pronoun",
     "texto": [
      "To choose within a group use **d'entre** + stressed pronoun: **certains d'entre eux** (some of them), **aucun d'entre nous** (none of us), **chacun d'entre vous** (each one of you)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Lequel de",
     "texto": [
      "To ask «which one of...» use **lequel de** + group: **Lequel de ces films est bon ?** (which one of these films is good?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
